## Recovery custody

Operation: `HIVE018-PACEBOARD-PUBLICATION-RECOVERY-ZCZC9V6-20260915`
Owner/finalizer: **Z-CairnZeta-1934-C9V6 (`ZCZ-C9V6`) / GPT-5.6 Sol Pro**
